WHY THE LARGEST FLANK FAILS  (exhaustive primitive 7-subsets of [1,30])

1) is d_max PRIME?
   prime=True :    46 failures /   479060 sets = 0.0096%
   prime=False:  2952 failures /  1550185 sets = 0.1904%
   -> composite flank fails 19.8x more often than prime

